# Blast from the Past (windurst 11): the eighth Fossil Rock's stone operand alone. Accepted by GM at Option 2 with the
# Burnite Shell Stone given by GM, Ichorous Ire never spawned: not spawned but the stone held: FOSSIL_EXTRACTED + 2, no
# spawn (the rock's default JUST_A_ROCK follows the handler's nil). The main flow's last rock talk follows the NM's kill,
# whose corpse may still count as spawned.
lists MazeOfShakhrami/Fossil_Rock/onTrigger
char zone=MazeOfShakhrami pos=-89.8,13.6,-105.0 lvl=75
quest Windurst.BlastFromThePast accepted
charvar Quest[2][11]Option 2
item BurniteShellStone
login
trigger Fossil_Rock+8                          # offset 8, the NM not up, the stone held: FOSSIL_EXTRACTED + 2
